{"description":"Six Minds - One Mission - Earth to Cosmos","image":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/Team-NAKKHATRA-399-Cover_3dT4MRv.2e16d0ba.fill-300x250.png","summary":"We built an integrated, web-based exploration platform designed to support future human missions. It will be helpful for future astronauts who are going to explore Mars physically. By using an advanced navigation system linked to NASA's high-level Mars data.","details":"<p>Martian Map is an interactive web-based map that brings together NASA Mars mission data to help users explore potential locations and routes for future human activities on Mars. It combines terrain, elevation, imagery, and scientific datasets into a layered map to support safer and more informed exploration and route planning.</p>","dataRefs":[["Perseverance’s Traverse","https://science.nasa.gov/resource/perseverances-traverse-from-seitah-to-jezero-delta"],["Elevation Data","https://pds.nasa.gov/ds-view/pds/viewDataset.jsp?dsid=MRO-M-HIRISE-5-DTM-V1.0"],["Orthomosaic Imagery","https://ode.rsl.wustl.edu/mars/"],["Hillshade","https://stac.astrogeology.usgs.gov/docs/data/mars/hirise_dtms/"],["HiRISE-derived Slope Data","https://www.usgs.gov/data/mars-2020-terrain-relative-navigation-hirise-dtm-mosaic"],["Secondary Slope Data","https://www.usgs.gov/publications/analysis-local-slopes-insight-landing-site-mars"],["Terrain Hazard Data","https://www.usgs.gov/data/mars-2020-terrain-relative-navigation-hirise-dtm-mosaic"],["Confidence Data (FOM)","https://stac.astrogeology.usgs.gov/docs/data/mars/hirise_dtms/"]],"projectRefs":[],"members":[{"name":"Wahid Najim","country":"Bangladesh","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/WhatsApp_Image_2025-04-16_at_17.14.3.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"POLLOB KUMAR","country":"Bangladesh","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/Passport_size_pic_G_gW1q3q3.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":true},{"name":"Ather Israq Chowdhury"